@@ -0,0 +1,663 @@
+/*
+ * Copyright © 2025, Niklas Haas
+ * Copyright © 2018, VideoLAN and dav1d authors
+ * Copyright © 2018, Two Orioles, LLC
+ * All rights reserved.
