+;*****************************************************************************
+;* x86inc.asm: x86 abstraction layer
+;*****************************************************************************
+;* Copyright (C) 2005-2024 x264 project
+;*
+;* Authors: Loren Merritt <lorenm@u.washington.edu>
+;*          Henrik Gramner <henrik@gramner.com>
